              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شهریه (shahriye) — \"tuition fees\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شهریه این دانشگاه گران است. shahriye-ye in dâneshgâh gerân ast. The fees at this university are high."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also the monthly fee for a private class or a kindergarten."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شهریه (shahriye) is usually traced to Arabic shahriyya \"monthly\", from Arabic shahr \"month\" (a different word from Persian shahr \"city\"): a fee once paid by the month."
            }
          ]
        },
