            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او در رشته پزشکی پذیرفته شد. u dar reshte-ye pezeshki pazirofte shod. She was admitted to study medicine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pazirofte, the participle of paziroftan \"to accept\" (present stem pazir-), + shodan."
            }
          ]
        },
