          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پذیرفته شدن (pazirofte shodan) is native Persian, built from pazirofte, the participle of paziroftan \"to accept\", which EtymDB traces to Middle Persian, and shodan \"to become\", which makes it passive."
            }
          ]
        },
